{"version":"V28.13-print-save","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T06:00:00.000Z","note":"V28.13 Shield rail/scheme export: 'Печать PDF' opens a print window with the active view (rails or single-line scheme) -> save as PDF; 'Сохранить' exports the active view as PNG. Rails are rendered to a self-contained SVG for export so both tabs use one offline path (SVG -> canvas -> PNG; SVG -> print window). No external libraries, works offline."}
